is a Japanese light novel series written by Mugi Mameta and illustrated by Nagisa Hanazome. It was originally serialized on the user-generated novel publishing website Shōsetsuka ni Narō between April 2022 and October 2023. It was later acquired by Futabasha who began publishing it under their M Novels f imprint in October 2022. A manga adaptation illustrated by Toi Ishino began serialization on Futabasha's Gaugau Monster manga website in January 2023. An anime adaptation has been announced.
Synopsis
Abigail starts to panic when she is told by her groom that he will never love her. After years of neglect at the hands of her noble family, due to her being the reincarnation of the former demon lord, Abigail believed that she would finally receive a stable food supply with her marriage to Gerald, but his declaration makes her uneasy.
